  "name": "Example: Identifying the Terms of a Sequence Given as a List",
  "problem": "What is the sum of the first and last terms of the following sequence? \n\n$$\n3,\\quad-5,\\quad7,\\quad-9,\\quad11,\\quad-13,\\quad15\n$$",
  "worked_solution": "The first term is $3$ and the last term is $15.$ Their sum is $3+15 = 18.$",
